WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.420
Last summer, Hilda worked as a volunteer with dolphin trainers at a sea life park.
去年夏天，希尔达在一家海洋生物公园当志愿者，协助海豚训练员工作。

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:13.860
Her job was to make sure the tanks were free of any items so that the trainers could train the dolphins to fetch specific items.
她的工作是确保水池里没有任何杂物，以便训练员训练海豚去叼取指定的物品。

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:21.290
However, one day after cleaning, one of the dolphins, Maya, presented Hilda with a candy wrapper from the tank.
然而有一天，清理完水池后，一头名叫玛雅的海豚却从池里叼来一张糖纸，交给了希尔达。

00:00:22.090 --> 00:00:27.190
When Katherine, the trainer, saw this, she blamed Hilda for her carelessness.
训练员凯瑟琳看到后，责怪希尔达太粗心。

00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:32.780
Upset but not discouraged by this event, Hilda decided to do some spying on Maya.
这件事让希尔达很难过，但她并没有气馁，决定暗中观察一下玛雅。

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:36.570
The next morning, Hilda arrived at the park early.
第二天早上，希尔达很早就来到了公园。

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:41.780
She put on her scuba gear and jumped into the tank for her usual underwater sweep.
她穿上水下呼吸器，跳进水池，像往常一样在水下清扫一遍。

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:48.740
Finding nothing in the tank, she climbed out of the water just in time to see Katherine jumping in on the other side.
池里什么也没找到，她爬出水面，正好看见凯瑟琳从另一侧跳进池里。

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:53.210
After what had happened the day before, Hilda knew what she was doing.
有了前一天的事，希尔达很清楚凯瑟琳这是在做什么。

00:00:54.010 --> 00:01:00.350
She watched as Katherine performed her underwater search, but Hilda wasn’t surprised when she surfaced empty-handed.
她看着凯瑟琳在水下搜寻了一番，等凯瑟琳两手空空地浮出水面时，希尔达并不意外。

00:01:01.150 --> 00:01:10.510
During the tank sweeps, Maya had been swimming playfully, but now the dolphin stopped suddenly and swam to the back part of the tank where the filter box was located.
清扫水池时，玛雅一直在欢快地游来游去，可这时它突然停了下来，游到水池后部放过滤箱的地方。

00:01:11.310 --> 00:01:14.340
She stuck her nose down behind the box and then swam away.
它把鼻子伸到箱子后面，然后游开了。

00:01:15.140 --> 00:01:17.650
What was Maya doing back there? Hilda wondered.
玛雅在那后面干什么呢？希尔达心里纳闷。

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:24.270
She jumped back into the water and swam over to take a look behind the box, and her question was answered.
她又跳回水里，游过去到箱子后面看了看，心中的疑问有了答案。

00:01:25.070 --> 00:01:31.970
Hilda then swam across the tank following Maya’s path and emerged from the water to find Katherine removing her scuba gear.
接着，希尔达顺着玛雅游过的路线游过水池，钻出水面，发现凯瑟琳正在脱潜水装备。

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:35.770
As Katherine turned around, her mouth dropped open.
凯瑟琳一转身，惊得张大了嘴。

00:01:36.570 --> 00:01:40.810
There was Maya at the edge of the tank with a comb in her mouth waiting for her treat.
只见玛雅待在池边，嘴里叼着一把梳子，等着领奖励。

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:42.190
“Maya!
“玛雅！

00:01:42.990 --> 00:01:47.400
Where did you get that?” demanded Katherine, taking the comb and throwing her a fish.
你从哪儿弄来的？”凯瑟琳追问道，一边拿过梳子，一边扔给它一条鱼。

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:55.180
“I know where she got it,” declared Hilda, climbing out of the tank with a handful of items still wet from their watery resting place.
“我知道它是从哪儿弄来的。”希尔达大声说道，一边爬出水池，手里攥着一把刚从水底藏处捞出、还湿漉漉的东西。

00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:59.260
“What’s all this?” Katherine asked, obviously confused.
“这都是些什么？”凯瑟琳问，显然一头雾水。

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:02.830
“This is Maya’s secret,” Hilda said with a big smile.
“这就是玛雅的秘密。”希尔达笑容满面地说。

00:02:03.630 --> 00:02:05.980
Now Katherine realized what had been going on.
这时，凯瑟琳才明白是怎么回事。
